+-   Add the ``capture`` parameter to ``CliRunner``. The default
+    ``capture="sys"`` captures Python-level writes only, and ``fileno()`` on
+    the redirected streams raises ``io.UnsupportedOperation`` again, reverting
+    the 8.3.3 change that exposed the original file descriptor and broke
+    Pytest's fd-level capture teardown. ``capture="fd"`` redirects file
+    descriptors ``1`` and ``2`` to a temporary file instead, capturing output
+    from C extensions and subprocesses as well, and keeping ``faulthandler``
+    working. It is not supported on Windows. :issue:`3384` :issue:`2865`
+    :pr:`3244`
 
